{"id":43257,"date":"2025-11-20T21:26:42","date_gmt":"2025-11-21T02:26:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/upwithwomenstg.wpengine.com\/?page_id=43257"},"modified":"2026-01-09T12:01:19","modified_gmt":"2026-01-09T17:01:19","slug":"growth-connection-hub","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/changing-the-conversation\/growth-connection-hub\/","title":{"rendered":"Growth &amp; Connection Hub"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-large getwid-padding-bottom-large getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:1140px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-primary-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\" style=\"opacity:1;background-color:#FFD700\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized wp-duotone-000000-000000-1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"332\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-1024x332.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-43276\" style=\"width:450px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-1024x332.png 1024w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-300x97.png 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-768x249.png 768w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-1536x499.png 1536w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UWW_GCH_LOGO_YELLOW-2048x665.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">Up With Women&#8217;s Growth &amp; Connection Hub is a dedicated space for learning, reflection, and shared capacity-building across our volunteer network, community partners, and collaborators who help deliver programming to our clients.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">The training modules offered through this program explore core themes that shape our work\u2014including the lived experiences of poverty, intersectionality, systemic bias, and trauma-informed communication. Each course is grounded in the realities our clients navigate and is designed to strengthen collective understanding, shared language, and community-centred approaches.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">Through this program, volunteers and partners gain deeper insight into the systemic barriers that influence client journeys and strengthen the practices that make our programming more responsive, inclusive, and effective. The Hub reinforces a shared commitment to advancing equity and supporting clients with the dignity, care, and respect they deserve.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:1140px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-custom-white-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:27px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left is-style-heading-underline\">COURSES<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ba164f1404176b6229a2707004aed69d\">Our trainings are designed to equip our community members with the insight, tools, and confidence to better support our clients and advance equity in every space they move through.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-none getwid-padding-bottom-none getwid-padding-left-none getwid-padding-right-small\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background\" style=\"background-color:#fafafa\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box has-image-left has-text-left has-mobile-layout-default has-mobile-alignment-default\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__image-container is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"898\" hei